/* ============================================================
   L.A.P. — mini launchpad
   One synthesized drum kit, inspired by the punchy kicks, snappy
   layered claps, shuffled hats and pitched stabs of Fred again..'s
   live sets. No samples — everything below is generated in real
   time with the Web Audio API, so the whole kit lives in this file.
   ============================================================ */

